ll,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:16:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691022","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920680-1841579228670528","game_id":"steam-4920680","kind":"update","title":"Update V0.62: Unit Grouping is Finally Here!","summary":"Unit Grouping (At Last) Unit grouping is here. When you select multiple units, a small + button appears in the top left. Click it to create a group, and you can instantly select them later using the hotkey or the UI button. Received a lot of feedback on this oneTactical Pause Before the Battle Battles no longer start instantly. When you click \"play with recommended army\", the battle now starts paused so you can take your time to plan your strategy first.Better Tutorial Experience Tutorial text s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T01:25:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670528","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920680-1841579228667297","game_id":"steam-4920680","kind":"announcement","title":"V0.58: Flawless Pathfinding & Playable Editor","summary":"This update brings a major fix to pathfinding and makes the level editor much more interactive.Pathfinding Fixed: Units can now navigate through narrow passages and bridges smoothly. It's a massive improvement over the old systemMulti-Unit Path Drawing: I fixed the left-click and hold path-drawing mechanic. You can now draw manual paths for multiple selected units simultaneouslyPlayable Level Editor: You used to only be able to watch AI vs AI battles in the level editor. Now, you can pick a side","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T01:19:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228667297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920680-1841579228661072","game_id":"steam-4920680","kind":"announcement","title":"V0.53: Modern Age, 0.5x Speed and Range Rings","summary":"The modern era roster is now complete with 10 units and 2 structures:Light Infantry, Assault Rifle Infantry, Main Battle Tank, IFVFPV Drone, Fighter Jet, Attack Drone.MLRS, Mobile Air Defense, Self-Propelled HowitzerPanel Apartment, Drone NetworkThis era plays differently. Armies are smaller and more expensive, preventing unit spam. Almost every unit has anti-tank weapons. A lone tank is no longer a fortress; if unprotected, basic infantry will shred it.The real change is the airspace. FPV drone","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T22:45:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228661072","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920680-1840944183779715","game_id":"steam-4920680","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.49: The Normandy Campaign, UI Filters & A Gift Key for Modders!","summary":"Hey everyone,Update 0.49 is now live for the Warlapse demo.... I have been working on adding new content and smoothing out the interface, and today brings a major addition to your tactical testing grounds.What's New in v0.49:The Normandy Campaign Added: A brand new historical campaign is now playable. Time to test your formations, logistics, and tactical adaptability on the beaches of Normandy.Skirmish Menu Filters: Navigating your scenarios is now much easier. A filter system has been added to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T13:54:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4920680-1840944183775229","game_id":"steam-4920680","kind":"announcement","title":"Day 1 Fix","summary":"Balanced the Moscow, Manzikert, and Flers-Courcelette skirmishes. Also made a minor performance fix","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T23:18:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775229","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:49:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4920680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4920680":"2026-10-26T05:12:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4920680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5018690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:12:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4920680","app_id":4920680,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c26097ec87edfec772ccbcc3267766e1fbb4b60abcefe69f380c97d8f1bcc556","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"전쟁은 영웅주의가 아니라 냉혹한 질서와 기동의 문제다. 석기시대부터 현대까지 이어지는 7개 시대에 걸쳐 적을 포위하고, 보급을 끊고, 사기를 무너뜨려 killbox 안에서 섬멸하라. Campaign에서 고참병을 이끌고, 빠른 Skirmish에 뛰어들거나, 직접 유닛을 디자인해 MOD로 미래의 전쟁을 만들어라!","publishers":[{"name":"Bad Engine Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46138166}],"developers":[{"name"